      "key_id": "761895198",
      "translation_id": "7149701091",
      "en": "Your Shelly device {device_name} with IP address {ip_address} has an open Wi-Fi access point enabled without a password. This is a security risk as anyone nearby can connect to the device.\n\nNote: If you disable the access point, the device may need to restart.",
